OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors describe Russell Brand as
OL,8,F"ruthless" and a "sexual predator" as
OL,9,Fthe 51-year-old goes on trial on
OL,10,Fcharges of rape and sexual assault
OL,12,FOpening the prosecution's case, Riel
OL,13,FKarmy-Jones KC says Brand had a
OL,14,F"childlike" expectation that his
OL,15,F"voracious" desires should be met
OL,17,FTurning to testimony from a former
OL,18,Ffriend of Brand's, Karmy-Jones says
OL,19,FBrand once said he wanted to "bed 5,000
OL,20,Fwomen" in his lifetime - here's what
OL,21,Felse we heard
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/20
