OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comedian and actor has pleaded not
OL,8,Fguilty to three counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcounts of sexual assault and one count
OL,10,Fof indecent assault
OL,12,FThe allegations, from six women, date
OL,13,Ffrom 1999-2009 - all are legally
OL,14,Fentitled to lifelong anonymity
OL,16,FArriving at court earlier, Brand said
OL,17,Fhe felt "blessed", adding: "I feel of
OL,18,Fcourse concerned but hopeful this
OL,19,Fprocess will lead to good outcomes for
OL,20,Feverybody - that is my prayer"
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/20
