OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe trial is expected to last up to six
OL,8,Fweeks at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,9,Fcentral London
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/20
