OL,3,ARussell T Davies criticises BBC boss's
OL,4,A'clumsy' AI Doctor Who comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FLongtime Doctor Who writer and
OL,7,Fshowrunner Russell T Davies has
OL,8,Fcriticised the new BBC director general
OL,9,Fover comments he made about an
OL,10,FAI-generated episode of the show.
OL,12,FMatt Brittin told a Royal Television
OL,13,FSociety conference in September that he
OL,14,Fhad been sent a "pretty good" 50-minute
OL,15,Funofficial Doctor Who episode.
OL,17,F"That's a clumsy thing to say in an
OL,18,Findustry where he's got writers and
OL,19,Fartists and it specifically affects
OL,20,Fpeople, they're the first to take the
OL,21,Fblow," Davies told BBC Radio 4's The
OL,22,FMedia Show.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
